Package: soryos-fonts
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SoryOS Team <maintainers@soryos.local>
Depends: fonts-open-sans, fonts-noto-core, fonts-noto-color-emoji
Description: SoryOS font selection package
 This package defines the SoryOS desktop font boundary. It currently depends on
 stable Ubuntu/Debian font packages while SoryOS-specific typography is
 designed and packaged.
Section: fonts
Priority: optional
